{"id":"n70718-1-2","stage":0,"title":"그렇지만 · 即便是那样","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70718-1-2-1","ko":"우리 같이 갔던 식당 좋았는데.","zh":"我们之前一起去的那家餐厅很不错呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一起，一同","explanation":"같이：一起，一同","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"1","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갔던","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"식당","meaning":"饭店，餐厅","explanation":"식당：饭店，餐厅","readings":[{"term":"식당","audio":"/audio/fe047fb6c566f2771257.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36693","senseId":"2","lemma":"식당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋았는데.","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"d44da011993f2a6e","term":"같이","zh":"一起，一同","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3","entryId":"26799","definition":"两个以上同时。","pronunciation":["가치"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"fe047fb6c566f277","term":"식당","zh":"饭店，餐厅","au